只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Multi-provider Web Search & Fetch for DeepSeek Harness — 8 deeply adapted providers, SearchHints, resilient fallback, and native X / Xiaohongshu retrieval.","id":"gh:1335219884","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-web-tools","slug":"A3Boy/dsh-web-tools","topics":["ai-agent","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","exa","firecrawl","searxng","self-hosted","tavily","typescript","web-search"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Multi-provider Web Search & Fetch for DeepSeek Harness — 8 deeply adapted providers, SearchHints, re"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"silient fallback, and native X / Xiaohongshu retrieval."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-web-tools"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Empower DeepSeek Harness with unified search and deep content extraction across the open web and soc"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ek Harness with unified search and deep content extraction across the open web and social platforms."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Native-Capability Adaptation Across 9 Web Providers · SearchHints Semantic Compilation · Multi-Sou"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"rce Resilience · Xiaohongshu & Twitter / X Retrieval**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**English** | 简体中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## What problem does it solve?"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"When web access depends on a single provider, exhausted quota, rate limits, or timeouts can interrup"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"t retrieval. Wrapping multiple APIs with a naive proxy often flattens them to a lowest common denomi"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"nator, failing to leverage each provider's specialized search modes, categories, freshness, domain r"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ules, and extraction capabilities."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"dsh-web-tools connects Exa, Tavily, Firecrawl, Parallel, Brave, You.com, Jina, Keenable, SearXNG, Xi"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"aohongshu, and Twitter / X to DSH’s standard `web_search` / `web_fetch` interface."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"While keeping the tool interface unified, dsh-web-tools normalizes search intents through SearchHint"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"s and compiles queries into native provider-specific parameters. This leverages each engine's native"},{"id":"p9s3","text":" categories, freshness filters, domain policies, regional targeting, and content extraction, while m"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"aximizing uptime through multi-key allocation, automated failover, and dedicated browser profiles."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**Key Highlights**:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- **Native-Capability Adaptation Across 9 Web Providers**: Keeps the standard `web_search` / `web_fe"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"tch` contracts while compiling unified search intent into provider-specific native parameters instea"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"d of reducing every backend to the same lowest-common-denominator feature set.\n- **SearchHints → Pro"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"vider-Specific Parameter Compilation**: Normalizes technical, research, news, date, region, and doma"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"in constraints from queries, compiling them into provider-native parameters through deterministic co"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"de without additional LLM latency.\n- **Xiaohongshu & Twitter / X Platform Sources**: Both platforms "},{"id":"p11s7","text":"support signed-in native search, detail extraction, and returned comments or replies through dedicat"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"ed local browser profiles.\n- **Multi-Source Scheduling & Resilience**: Features multi-API-key poolin"},{"id":"p11s9","text":"g, 401 failover, 429 cooldown windows, configurable Ordered / Round-Robin / Random routing, and fail"},{"id":"p11s10","text":"over chains.\n- **Native DSH Tool Integration**: Plugs directly into standard `web_search` / `web_fet"},{"id":"p11s11","text":"ch` without requiring new tool declarations, and includes a session-level \"Search Mode\" toggle."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Native-Capability Adaptation Across 9 Web Providers"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The tool interface and search semantics are unified for the DSH agent, but underlying provider capab"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ce and search semantics are unified for the DSH agent, but underlying provider capabilities are not."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"dsh-web-tools expresses query intent through SearchHints and crafts dedicated requests for each prov"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ider, rather than compressing all backends into a single set of lowest-common-denominator parameters"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"der, rather than compressing all backends into a single set of lowest-common-denominator parameters."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"For example, when searching for \"AI coding references from the past week\":"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"* **Exa**: Maps category filters, ISO date ranges, and domain constraints;\n* **Firecrawl**: Maps tec"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"hnical queries to the native `github` category, research queries to `research`, and applies `tbs` fr"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"eshness filters;\n* **Parallel**: Deconstructs the query into `objective`, clean `search_queries`, an"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"d `source_policy`;\n* **Brave Search**: Maps freshness, country, and language parameters with priorit"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"y LLM Context endpoint;\n* **You.com**: Leverages `boost_domains` for soft domain preference."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"All adaptations run through deterministic code without invoking an extra LLM call."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"* **Exa**: Category mapping (`publication` / `news` / `financial report`), ISO-8601 date ranges, and"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" domain constraints.\n* **Firecrawl**: Maps coding and technical queries to the `github` category, ac"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ademic queries to `research`, and supports `tbs`, domain constraints, and clean Markdown extraction."},{"id":"p19s4","text":"\n* **Parallel**: Dual-layer semantics (`objective` soft-steering + clean `search_queries`) and `sour"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"ce_policy` domain/freshness filters.\n* **Tavily**: Supports `basic` / `advanced` / `fast` / `ultra-f"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"ast` search depths; `basic`, `advanced`, and `fast` support `chunks_per_source`, with native `news` "},{"id":"p19s7","text":"/ `finance` topics, date ranges, country, and domain constraints.\n* **Brave Search**: LLM Context en"},{"id":"p19s8","text":"dpoint with `pd/pw/pm/py` freshness filters, country, and search language.\n* **You.com**: Native **`"},{"id":"p19s9","text":"boost_domains`** soft-weighting, freshness presets, and geo/language targeting.\n* **Jina**: Query no"},{"id":"p19s10","text":"ise reduction and ReaderLM-v2 high-precision markdown extraction.\n* **SearXNG**: Self-hosted metasea"},{"id":"p19s11","text":"rch with `categories` (it/science/news) and `time_range`.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Provider Capabilities"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Provider | Search | Fetch / Extract | Key Integrations & Adaptations | Quota Inspection |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Exa | Yes | Yes, `/contents` | Semantic retrieval (`auto` / `fast` / `deep`), `category` mappings,"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" query-aware highlights, ISO-8601 date ranges | Dashboard only |\n| Tavily | Yes | Yes, `/extract` | "},{"id":"p22s3","text":"Search depths (`basic` / `advanced` / `fast` / `ultra-fast`); the first three support chunking, plus"},{"id":"p22s4","text":" `news` / `finance`, date, country, and domain parameters | Official API |\n| Firecrawl | Yes | Yes, "},{"id":"p22s5","text":"`/scrape` | Technical queries map to `github`, academic queries to `research`; supports `tbs`, domai"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"n constraints, and clean Markdown extraction | Official API |\n| Parallel | Yes | Yes, `/v1/extract` "},{"id":"p22s7","text":"| Agent dual-layer semantic search (`advanced` / `basic` / `turbo`), `objective` soft-steering, `sou"},{"id":"p22s8","text":"rce_policy` | Dashboard only |\n| Brave Search | Yes | — | Preferred LLM Context pre-extraction with "},{"id":"p22s9","text":"`pd/pw/pm/py` freshness, country/lang filters, auto fallback to Classic Search | Response headers |\n"},{"id":"p22s10","text":"| You.com | Yes | Yes, `/v1/contents` | Snippet highlights, native **`boost_domains`** soft-weightin"},{"id":"p22s11","text":"g, freshness and country/lang filters, markdown endpoint | Official API |\n| Jina | Yes | Yes, Reader"},{"id":"p22s12","text":" | Search query noise filtering, ReaderLM-v2 high-precision markdown, token budget and truncation co"},{"id":"p22s13","text":"ntrol | Best-effort |\n| SearXNG | Yes | — | Open-source self-hosted metasearch with `categories` and"},{"id":"p22s14","text":" supported `time_range` values; the adapter requires no API key | Instance-defined |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
